.TH tkeditor n 0.28.0 tkutils "Tcl/Tk Utility Library"
.SH NAME
tkutils::tkeditor \- simple text editor
.SH SYNOPSIS
package require tkutils::tkeditor
.br
set w [::tkutils::tkeditor::widget .w]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Editable text widget with file load/save, search and modified tracking. File I/O
uses the tclutils common helpers. See docs/tkeditor.md.
.SH "SEE ALSO"
tclutils(n)
.SH KEYWORDS
Tk, widget, editor
